// setup_player.vtest: no freeze time / warmup / team intro, no bots, join CT, wait for the spawn.
// No mp_restartgame: a restart right before `record` left client prediction stuck ("Prediction time ... less
// than sim time ... Clamping" forever, input ignored, demo never started).
// ($0 is this fragment's name; arguments start at $1.) mp_team_intro_time 0: the post-restart
// team intro camera ignores input and makes getpos report the camera, not the player.
mp_freezetime 0
mp_team_intro_time 0
mp_warmup_end
mp_ignore_round_win_conditions 1
mp_roundtime 60
mp_round_restart_delay 0
bot_quota 0
bot_kick
jointeam 3 1
Test_Wait 4
Test_Run mark VTEST_SPAWNED
